    "title": "Excel盘点",
    "keywords": "",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<p><video src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202503/e3669258007e0286d0fbc554accb6069.mp4\" controls=\"controls\" class=\"my-video\" style=\"max-width:100%\">\n\n\n视频描述\n</video></p>\n<p>1.操作路径：点击左侧栏库存-盘点-Excel盘点</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202501/309aae51c2c15780ecde3abbfe17691c.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>2.然后点击导出</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202501/8fca2650e8809a2fabc7a6c46fb0a698.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>3.选择要盘点的门店或者仓库，和盘点的商品</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202501/52a437745db7d3b186687e546d6eb153.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>4.下载的表格录输入要盘的商品的实际库存数量，然后点击导入。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202501/2b1d7f263df6a3c70662ea13ae6a3167.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>5.导入成功后会显示导入成功和导入失败的商品。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202501/70f4fde8068c17ed8094965ca4708cce.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>6.点击查看盘点单，可以看到导入成功的商品。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202501/e42ce7c276c2b60cb0aa69222fcdf71e.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>7.可以点击下载导入失败的商品查看原因，没有填写实际数量的商品不能导入。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202501/97b58ca0ddbadfdd99f252930ab7815d.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>8.确定没有问题点击完成即可自动生成盘点单</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202501/5764c1e303d866e0c6c853c8eb59045b.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n",
